  "description": "Whether it's a leisurely ride around your neighbourhood or an epic journey across several continents, we've got you covered – the Kinesis GTD V2 is here.Our premier titanium road bike frameset has returned, enhanced with a range of refinements for an even more memorable ride. Whether you're participating in endurance races, century rides, or commuting in style, the GTD frameset provides pure riding pleasure on every journey.Rider Fit Geometry ensures redistributed sizing based on stack and reach measurements, with semi-sloping frames on the smallest sizes. This reduces the stand-over height while bringing comfort in line with our larger models.The GTD is designed for all-weather riding because we believe that the exceptional ride of our custom titanium tubeset should not be limited to summer Sundays. It’s perfectly built for perfect rides.",
